Traps don't depend on your level, only on the level in the
dungeon.  Level 8 and below can have a polymorph trap even if
you're XP1.  (I think they can occur even higher in a bones
level in the mines.)  Meanness of monsters, however, does depend
on your level (and the level in the mines).

How big an issue this might be depends on a lot of things.  I
don't think I'd want to reach XP10 with an AC of only 8 or 9.
(But in practice, it won't happen anyway.)

